[node name="Label" type="RichTextLabel" parent="FileBoxes/TitlesTxt" index="1"]
offset_left = 3.0
offset_top = 4.0
offset_right = 923.0
offset_bottom = 384.0
scale = Vector2(0.25, 0.25)
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.196078, 0.196078, 0.196078, 1)
text = "
From Jiofef to everyone.
For more than a year of development, I have not used almost any other people's assets.
However, I couldn't create some things myself in the form I wanted, so I had to borrow.
I want to thank:
FFF Media Inc and Daymarius for the fonts.
sfxBUZZ and SoundJay for some sounds.
Pixabay for various assets, mostly sounds.

Almost everything else was done by the only employee of the Paradise Underground studio called Jiofef



All rights reserved btw ;p"

